refactor(sidebar-chat): extract design tokens and add Electron Forge packaging

- Split SidebarChat styling into dedicated modules under
  react/src/sidebar-tsx/styles/ (designTokens, sidebarChatStyles,
  sidebarChat.css, sidebarChatStrings) to centralize color/spacing/
  typography tokens aligned with VS Code theme variables.
- Wire SidebarChat.tsx and chatThreadService.ts to the new tokens; no
  behavioral changes to chat flow.
- Enhance sendLLMMessage workspace file search: add JP->EN synonym
  expansion, baseline manifest/entry inclusion, directory tree output,
  and pending-injection hook for mid-phase user interrupts.
- Tune sendLLMMessage channel/impl/types to plumb the injection getter
  through the IPC boundary.
- Add Electron Forge packaging setup (forge.config.js, makers,
  publishers, fuses, squirrel-startup) and refresh package.json /
  package-lock.json accordingly.
- Redesign chatgpt-info.html landing with Inter/Noto Sans JP,
  glassmorphism hero, animated ambient gradients, and responsive grid.
- Refresh light/dark theme JSON tokens for better contrast.
- Overhaul .division/* role docs (CODER, DESIGNER, WRITING, RESEARCH,
  PLANNING, IDEAMAN, SEARCH, FILE-SEARCH, REVIEW) to the SidebarChat-
  focused spec and add .orchestration-state.json snapshot.
- Update .vscode/settings.json and open-remote-ssh extension metadata.
